    "Keep BetterNotes open on both devices until the transfer finishes. Conflicting edits are saved as separate notebooks in Archive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "传输完成前，请在两台设备上保持 BetterNotes 开启。冲突的编辑会另存为独立笔记本，放在“存档”中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "傳輸完成前，請在兩臺裝置上保持 BetterNotes 開啟。衝突的編輯會另存為獨立筆記本，放在「存檔」中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep both copies": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留两份"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留兩份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep both copies saves the other version as a notebook in Archive. The other options discard the edit that loses. Use the same setting on both devices; Newest edit wins relies on both clocks being correct.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“保留两份”会把另一个版本作为笔记本存入存档。其他选项会丢弃落败的编辑。请在两台设备上使用相同的设置；“以最新编辑为准”要求两台设备的时钟都准确。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「保留兩份」會把另一個版本作為筆記本存入存檔。其他選項會捨棄落敗的編輯。請在兩臺裝置上使用相同的設定；「以最新編輯為準」要求兩臺裝置的時鐘都準確。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
