    "Once paired, notes sync over the local network while both apps are open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对后，只要两台设备都打开应用，笔记就会通过局域网同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配對後，只要兩臺裝置都開啟應用，筆記就會透過區域網同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only accept a device you recognize. Both libraries will exchange editable notebooks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只接受你认识的设备。两台设备将交换可编辑的笔记本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只接受你認識的裝置。兩臺裝置將交換可編輯的筆記本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only for models that accept image input (e.g. GPT-4o, Claude 3+, Gemini). Increases request size and cost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅适用于支持图片输入的模型（例如 GPT-4o、Claude 3+ 和 Gemini）。发送图片会增加请求大小和费用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅適用於支援圖片輸入的模型（例如 GPT-4o、Claude 3+ 和 Gemini）。傳送圖片會增加請求大小和費用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only passages selected for an explicit assistant or search request are sent (plus page images, when Send Page Images is on). The key is stored in this device's Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅发送为明确助理或搜索请求选择的段落（加上页面图像，当发送页面图像处于启用状态时）。密钥存储在该设备的钥匙串中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅傳送為明確助理或搜尋請求選擇的段落（加上頁面影象，當傳送頁面影象處於啟用狀態時）。金鑰儲存在該裝置的鑰匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
